id: pm-vcs-g7sy
title: Myers diff and unified hunks over lines and trees
description: "An O(ND) Myers diff producing edit scripts, grouped into hunks with context and rendered as unified diff. Tree diff walks two trees in sorted order and classifies each path as added, deleted or modified without reading blobs whose ids already match."
